{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_5331cb469b82","title":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158121&idx=1&sn=b23bac67fcafc1170f255aae18e81fa1&chksm=f0fab7a6c0cc2716f468b63ef7e8c22c03da49c4770c9ef4394dc1cb7fd6dfeb02e55c87574b&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"每天为大家精选各类情报分析相关的资源、工具、技巧和资讯，努力成为情报分析师必备的工具箱。外挂机器人“小丁丁”还能陪您聊天，给您查航班、查列车、查天气、查酒店、查美食、查股票、回答您的提问等等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUGrobmT8GcLqtMLDWHBic3PZ9IicdJxicSLTTBibQicVAuj4AGD0LclNYnTwuHbwWvGlrsVxZCvB2GwE%2F0","updated":"2026-11-28T03:53:53.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158121:1","title":"【资料】湾湾军事期刊文献汇总分析报告（26年10月）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158121&idx=1&sn=b23bac67fcafc1170f255aae18e81fa1&chksm=f0fab7a6c0cc2716f468b63ef7e8c22c03da49c4770c9ef4394dc1cb7fd6dfeb02e55c87574b&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"本报告以中国台湾地区防务部门军事期刊网站上公告日介于2026年10月1日至11月1日（该站采用民国纪年，即115.10.01—115.11.01）的全部PDF文件为分析对象。经逐层遍历「期刊列表—期次列表—专文列表」，共定位11种期刊、12个期次、107份PDF，累计1,799页。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGffAUxAJdspnIG4vFvP2518rXTmmxwe8YPU72O8rxdQtqs4ticRxQOibjZgrsyhGUObJIbzNWTyoT5eN5NkQoJXiadVSDeHRfDp0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-28T03:53:53.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158114:1","title":"【开源报告】日本国家情报局深度调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158114&idx=1&sn=a8a560990db8551fabf42cf5f72c450a&chksm=f02811f41df1a4d1039b16b0f50e70dbda98a4acb79351998d2cbe9b0fab630ffe577f3a6af1&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"截至2026年11月，日本情报体系发生了战后最为重大的一次结构性重组：2026年7月31日，《国家情报会议设置法》（令和8年法律第28号）施行，阁僚级“国家情报会议”成立，原“内阁情报调查室”升格改组为内阁官房直属的“国家情报局”","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEOyqWF8xPcR3bkOaLicgPByQ9tiaBm3vicicBfpVOokibQRfial0FmxQFgwS7QLSTuJa83QVDC378VjbCqDS0qOZJKgWolsNlickWKJo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-26T23:00:32.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158104:1","title":"【资料】美国国际开发署（USAID)247份文件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158104&idx=1&sn=6bd13ca3a5b1465dd8482fd828ee2407&chksm=f0a690f1f86341d29a8a8063e1cbae88cb79203b58322e05fea5f841229a6e8dca794bb8be14&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"最近，很久没有信息的美国国际开发署官网（https://www.usaid.gov/）放出了247份文件。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGF0QAZha8m6bmZwsCL7UXicx1TbupWcKId6iaJ6JhWcqLKjY50QFq33JkVHpdS9de2ibrp9D9OUdAiaaeas5tJ7ib82rictJ3N4tsQY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-26T01:33:47.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158098:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报在美国情报界的战略地位、实际作用与重要性分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158098&idx=1&sn=94e1c60842d349a45acf8706fb71f88c&chksm=f0034e2d18f3439593415c0e404611cdba99deb60af402511c58c90791e49bf0bb466e1e1c34&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"开源情报（OSINT）在美国情报界已完成\"从辅助手段到基础性学科\"的制度性跃升，但这一跃升在不同维度上并不均衡——政策与治理层面已明确核心化，资源与流程层面仍存在显著张力，能力层面则以\"与秘密情报互补而非替代\"为基本定位。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NF3pLPiabaHknsJjEeB2UujOrFQITpSI4Z0z5GWRm6s4VD9ddI3CiazjzJtKWyeZNC6MVNRrmheI3GrNFOKKfnIny2vSRub6DW9M%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158093:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报高级研究计划署（IARPA）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158093&idx=1&sn=0d3e91ac1d1a4cf447c2fb1a68094ecf&chksm=f0e9a8eb8d32b7705f82c04189b377869f6a0aeed4c44c10f54a5716022ce0a4de3f14d258f3&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"IARPA 是美国国家情报总监办公室下设的高风险、高回报科研资助机构，成立于 2007 年，被普遍视为情报界的DARPA 复制体：不设实验室、不做自有研究，而是以任期制的项目经理为核心，通过竞争性招标把研究外包给高校、企业和实验室，再把成果转移给情报界用户。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NE5kTSsSAkytqH3gdF6zT5JYvBgSCyzA7rC0VZeAMf49BCEmGb893ICTtQhPD45HDokPXzK4aVa1Mh1cUOj2EPibZgE1ibexvWOI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报基金会（OSINT Foundation）机构调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=1&sn=9be5e0d37772aba97c0f0f48607d3933&chksm=f0ca84ceaf80381308b283d6159370ecaa18185f7125f6340ed4e0217acff0f6b4871045746f&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"基金会自称为服务美国国家安全开源情报（OSINT）从业者的非营利专业协会与公众教育资源，战略目标为“发展从业者社群、规范化技能与认证、推动 OSINT 项目化与代表性”，明确不生产、不存储 OSINT，也不以执法或商业 OPEN-SOURCE 调查为主要对象。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGnOCib3s5M9gQX2FnCy3jz3nMIwiaTdibaKkWU3oxxYPqmiaU671c1yB9G8rxlYhjrvPSI1CRRAzaicwiaT9q2nDfkp8ZgXQvUES9Sw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:2","title":"【资料】情报研究指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=2&sn=09ddf1079aae1d34f92fd2a7b1b1bc20&chksm=f01af9077dca3950c0ef35a3fa6e46ae072f2f197ef36704b86f077536ee3d74ee4170837d7e&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"指南把“如何教、如何学、如何研究”这一复杂的问题，转化为一套可由教育者直接使用的结构化资源。它以七部分框架覆盖了从概念界定、历史演进、学科分类到政策监督与国际比较的完整知识链；以“平衡、完整、可支撑”的选材规范保证了作为教学材料的可靠性；","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHfBIQowztDgHd1rkIdWYZ33kRiabUIazP1XtTx7fYIzjiawRm3Z8EedsH8mHx2YGqiaRRbWzFZow3KUbHf55KGCYjNeQcic3ciadOE%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158080:1","title":"【开源报告】全球开源情报（OSINT） 活动生态与区域发展 调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158080&idx=1&sn=52660aba601a781b5993e385aa14a172&chksm=f0c65b6fbabc6572e0b4d1c6ee1c395112d89532a3d9d84b39f497a0c9c99144ac9558cada09&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"全球OSINT活动生态呈现“双极引领、多中心跟进”的格局：美国以“战略—协会—会展—荣誉”四位一体的制度化体系领先，中国以“学会主导、总体国家安全观统领、政产学研用协同”的技术产业化路径快速追赶，二者构成全球OSINT活动生态的两极。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGuANwKPkDx9JLpfnnZe9oVQtNToItCXPAwZAQTZYssf81uTXr1P51Vd0ADtgRrl60sZFvw10zyrjBurtWavDQSESSs6AtbVAY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T05:42:50.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报界与军方 开源情报（OSINT） 活动年表","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=1&sn=d7f7afaa88e3f4200232093e1921aa4b&chksm=f016dc93b04cc373900003a21b7ec4f018c65230cc9a11a3e66f6918de79dabcfae716f6fe12&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"本年在表系统梳理美国情报界与军方开源情报（OSINT）领域的会议、论坛、展览、颁奖及政策里程碑，时间跨度自 1941 年学科起源至 2026 年 11 月。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHibgcDwCaC5M0Ld5pKhwQbkmyXGUJuucGTmXu4jxy7STW1SB18VQ0icqXe2R403VZX5gnDMh4BHLXS7zGa8LT0JJIY3p7hxFy7s%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:2","title":"第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=2&sn=34c27a0a2e40be6ccdc8c35388bca0a2&chksm=f0dec82212a2e1fdf37b2fbf6a1d797b8f77186cee8b3c69bc6c440d2ce8a8bc1fa56e77d0f5&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"2026年11月14日至15日第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFsibxAH5CiaibAibU7wS78cSvVJibkeibSkMu2cicnqA9cyO8vxMoK6ibBQmouLCVjHPhv6eRkHMkMhJA6hzyflrQPSicFyu8XeuI5Jn1c%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158068:1","title":"【技巧】人工智能赋能开源情报（OSINT）实操指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158068&idx=1&sn=e8a0450ed82aa22f2a3e18d25fb69f1f&chksm=f059120e3b7c576e320b9923fc23ce89a8adbc7e7cb7bbc07c4d45015846ff5bb2c995f96fae&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"AI 在 OSINT 中的正确定位是放大器，不是替代品。放大器意味着：输入垃圾，输出更多垃圾；输入没有验证的线索，输出看起来更可信的谣言。所以本指南把“验证”放在与“采集”同等重要的位置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEboIRFsiczZGic1OKbGhH5sdhdpBKSnKcv8RDkuVTlC85ABZEFT8COYN6dAQgOh2eeMOFb0aQcfaczIeVibiabOtMGfb0ntpkrll4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T03:25:21.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158056:1","title":"【开源报告】俄乌战争中的俄罗斯军事情报： 失误、适应与代价（2022–2026）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158056&idx=1&sn=3c18cd4527bd957984b1e20002518c71&chksm=f0253edced157bd3601505b11c3e226461e408792a7c4be65ba5e99757f52fa34173ed3dbe52&scene=126&sessionid=1795853592#rd","description":"俄罗斯军事情报在战术—技术维度完成了战争史上罕见的快速学习，在战略—制度维度（评估独立性、问责、反间谍专业度）改进有限。这一不对称意味着：俄情报对\"已知战场\"的支撑持续增强，对\"未知变量\"（对手突然性、领导层偏见、己方制度缺陷）依然脆弱。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGzMQvbDD13YhLzSmuj3qib4XaykyMWSxWUOyib2dyNMfs4YtJIFSppoeriaILHKgZaeM75yEdwYQvtzbb0zNwvJZKjK987NjQRv0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-16T03:49:42.000Z"}]}